  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryLineData
  speakerName: "Ph\xF3 l\xE0ng"
  title: "Nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5"
  content: "\"T\u1EEB gi\u1EDD m\u1ECDi vi\u1EC7c c\u1EADu c\u1EA7n l\xE0m s\u1EBD
    hi\u1EC7n trong h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5. Nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 ch\xEDnh
    l\xE0 x\xE2y l\u1EA1i l\xE0ng, nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 ph\u1EE5 s\u1EBD gi\xFAp c\u1EADu
    th\xEAm ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng d\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng.\""
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
